      "title": "Z-Image-Turbo LoRA (and the shelf)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Z-Image-Turbo + the distill-patch LoRA \u2014 and the whole LoRA shelf\n\n`z_image_turbo_distill_patch_lora_bf16` (Comfy-Org/Z-Image-Turbo) refines the turbo model's\ndistillation. It is loaded with `LoraLoaderModelOnly` on the MODEL link between the UNET loader\nand ModelSamplingAuraFlow; the strength widget applies to the diffusion model only.\nRecommended strength 1.0; lower steps may suit the patch.\n\nThe `lora_name` widget lists EVERY LoRA on the pod's shared shelf (`models/loras`, the same host\ndirectory the other AI pods mount), so this one template is also the way to try any LoRA you drop\nthere \u2014 switch the widget and set a strength (0.5-1.0 for most LoRAs). No new template needed.\n\nBase models: `z_image_turbo_int8_convrot`, `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed`, `ae`."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
